# ── Rust ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build output at any depth (workspace root and member crates).
# installer/fetch-xserver.ps1 also writes the bundled X server to target/*/xserver.
target/
**/*.rs.bk
# MSVC debug symbols left behind by manual builds
*.pdb

# ── Site (Vite / npm) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
/site/node_modules/
/site/dist/
/site/.vite/
npm-debug.log*

# ── Release packaging ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# release.yml and installer/ruxt.iss (OutputDir=..\dist)
/dist/

# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Signing certificates and local secrets must never be committed
# (release.yml writes cert.pfx for a moment while signing).
*.pfx
*.p12
.env
.env.*

# ── Local runtime artefacts ──────────────────────────────────────────
*.log

# ── Local tooling ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Claude Code: personal settings only (shared .claude/settings.json may be committed)
.claude/settings.local.json
# Playwright MCP browser-test output
/.playwright-mcp/
# Development hand-over notes (not part of the published repository)
/context.md

# ── Editors ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── Merge / patch leftovers ──────────────────────────────────────────
*.orig
*.rej

# ── OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
